# Drizzle
drizzle/migrations/
# meta/ is tracked since the Amendment 20 follow-up: without the per-migration
# snapshots in git, `db:generate` diffs against a stale snapshot and bundles
# unrelated drift into every new migration (see 0005).

# WhatsApp sender agent (tools/whatsapp-agent) — device-local secrets and state.
# config.json holds DIGEST_AGENT_TOKEN; auth/ holds a live WhatsApp
# linked-device session (credentials equivalent to a logged-in WhatsApp Web).
# Neither may ever be committed. sent/ is the anti-double-post marker directory.
# (*.log above already covers agent.log and boot.log.)
tools/whatsapp-agent/config.json
tools/whatsapp-agent/auth/
tools/whatsapp-agent/sent/

